      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ready-to-walk-in opportunity to buy this amazing home. Built in 2008 to a very high specification this 220m (2368 ft) property is in excellent condition throughout. This stunning, light filled, modern home boasts many family comforts.\n\nWhen you come through the front door you enter a bright inviting entrance hallway with access to sitting room, ground floor bedroom ensuite and spacious kitchen/dining area great for entertaining and casual living. From the kitchen you have access to utility room, WC and spacious bedroom currently used as games/playroom.\n\nFirst floor offers spacious master bedroom with amazing walk-in closet, and ensuite bathroom. There are a further two bedrooms with two ensuite, office room and family bathroom and hot-press \n\n0.22 hectares (0.54-acre) site with stunning unspoilt landscape of Foxford. The site provides. \nyear-round colour with a variety of planting. \n\nDetached double car garage with two roller doors, single door access and staircase to first floor for further storage. Garage has its own boiler and oil tank along with toilet. Endless possibilities. External groundwork is complete including wall and large wrought iron gates to front and new tarmac driveway providing ample parking and lots of privacy.\n\nThe house is located in a commanding position just 1.5km from the town of Foxford, 12km to Swinford, 17km to Ballina and only 23km to Knock Airport. \n\nViewing of this superb one-off house comes highly recommended and is strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agent Carol Kelly.\n\nFeatures: \nB3 Rating\nPumped Walls/300ml insulation in attic along with stira stairs\nNew tarmac driveway\nPanelling in hallway and landing\nSolar Panels\nWrought Iron Gates\n4/5 spacious bedrooms 3 ensuite.\n220sqm living accommodation. \n0.22/0.54-acre hectare site\nLandscaped gardens. \nDouble car detached garage with electric roller doors.\nGarage has separate heating system with oil and boiler.\nToilet fitted in garage.\nOil fired central heating. \nFreestanding solid fuel stove in Sitting Room\n1.4km to National & Secondary schools\n\n"
      },
